    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nhues and base16\n\n### Description\n\nHiPhish has discontinued his old plugin, and has started https://gitlab.com/HiPhish/rainbow-delimiters.nvim\r\n\r\n\"Default highlight groups have the prefix RainbowDelimiter instead of TSRainbow, e.g. RainbowDelimiterRed instead of TSRainbowRed\"\r\n\r\nSo, they, too, will have to be added.",
